      "note": "Reviewed: the redirect target is always @blob.url — a signed URL generated by our own ActiveStorage service configuration, never a value taken directly from user input. This is the exact same pattern Rails' own ActiveStorage::Blobs::RedirectController#show uses (redirect_to @blob.url(...), allow_other_host: true); it's required so redirect-mode storage (disk/S3/etc.) works at all. Not an open redirect."
